("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1_2.2", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1_2.2", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1_2.2", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1_2.2", "order", "3")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1.1", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1.1", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1.1", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_1.1", "order", "2")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "text", "I was drawn into questions about God, suffering, love, marriage, power, consciousness and responsibility. I wanted to know whether intelligence could serve without becoming domination, and whether love could remain faithful without becoming possession.")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "child", "text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "order", "1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2.2", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2.2", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2.2", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2.2", "order", "3")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0", "text", "Those questions became personal. Relationship, family, work and the cost of trying to build something true became part of the evidence—not in the sense of proving a theory, but in the sense of testing whether an idea could survive contact with another person’s freedom.")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0", "child", "text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_3_0.0")
