("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "text", "The wider story also includes reported testimony associated with Chris Bledsoe: a Lady-associated message involving Regulus and new knowledge. I encountered this material as a possible parallel to the language of my own Easter experience.")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "child", "text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2_0.0", "order", "1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2.2", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2.2", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2.2", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_2.2", "order", "3")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "text", "I do not present the parallel as proof that the accounts share a supernatural source. The corpus preserves it as attributed testimony, with the precise date, transmission history and causal meaning still open to corroboration and alternative explanations.")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "child", "text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3_0.0", "order", "1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3.3", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3.3", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3.3", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_3.3", "order", "4")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_4", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_4", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_4_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_4_0.0", "text", "The responsible question is not “How do I make people accept this?” but “What kind of work follows if the claim is taken seriously without becoming an instrument of control?”")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_2_4_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
