("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_7_2_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_7_2_0.0", "text", "The Perth gathering is not a demand that people accept my story. It is an offering built from the questions my story opened. Come as a believer, doubter, churchgoer, musician, neighbour or servant. Bring your best. Leave the centre open.")
